    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton utility that calculates the uniform scale factor needed to fit a patent model within a configurable fraction of the device screen. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses the camera&apos;s FOV and the model&apos;s world-space bounds from PivotSetter.GetSpawnBounds. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
